      "Lower abdominal pain, unspecified",
      "Acute kidney failure, unspecified",
      "Pressure ulcer of left buttock, unstageable",
      "Dilated cardiomyopathy",
      "Chronic systolic (congestive) heart failure",
      "Hemiplegia and hemiparesis following cerebral infarction affecting left non-dominant side",
      "Morbid (severe) obesity due to excess calories",
      "Gross hematuria",
      "Family history of ischemic heart disease and other diseases of the circulatory system",
      "Retention of urine, unspecified",
      "Cystitis, unspecified with hematuria",
      "Long term (current) use of anticoagulants",
      "Atherosclerosis of other arteries",
      "Paroxysmal atrial fibrillation",
      "Type 2 diabetes mellitus with unspecified diabetic retinopathy without macular edema",
      "Hyperlipidemia, unspecified",
